  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14268510/assets/937f2c066850c63f41437c38c5e9e008a487f35efbbf90297c6cb0be45ce300f.png)\n\nA **dodecahedron** is a regular polyhedron that \n\n- consists of $12$ congruent faces, each in the form of a regular pentagon, and\n\n- exactly $3$ faces meet at each vertex.",
